cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "vecscope"
abstract: >-
  vecscope gives agents deterministic evidence about embedding spaces and
  vector indexes: hubness, anisotropy, collapse, distance concentration,
  duplicate neighbors, ANN recall against exact search, and HNSW/IVF
  parameter sweeps. Every finding reports the measured value, an
  ok/warn/fail verdict, the threshold that produced it and what healthy
  looks like. It runs as a CLI and as an MCP server, computes with NumPy
  only, and produces identical JSON for identical input.
